  "description": "Spacious 3 Bedroom House with Private Rear Garden – Curlew Road, Dublin 12\n\nDescription:\n\nHowley Souhan Estate Agents are delighted to present this well-proportioned three-bedroom house to the rental market, ideally located on Curlew Road, Dublin 12.\nThe property offers well-presented accommodation throughout, combining generous living space with a private rear garden and excellent natural light.\nUpon entering, the property comprises a welcoming hallway with stairs leading to the upper floor. The ground floor features a fully fitted kitchen with ample storage and a range of appliances, opening onto a spacious dining area. To the rear, a bright sunroom/conservatory provides an additional versatile living space with direct access to the private rear garden.\nThe property benefits from three well-proportioned bedrooms, each offering good natural light and ample space for furnishings and storage. The main bedroom features a traditional fireplace and built-in storage, while the additional bedrooms are also generously sized.\nThe accommodation is completed by a family bathroom with a shower enclosure, WC and wash hand basin.\nExternally, the property benefits from a private rear garden, featuring a paved patio area, lawn and established planting, providing an excellent outdoor space.\n\nKey Features\n- 3 Bedroom House\n- 1 Bathroom\n- Private Rear Garden\n- Bright Sunroom / Conservatory\n- Fully Fitted Kitchen\n- Dining Area\n- Traditional Fireplace\n- Excellent Natural Light\n- Wooden Flooring\n- Ample Bedroom Storage\n- Located in Dublin 12\n- €3,000 per month",
